message: "Trinity S3AI Framework - Complete Scientific Collection"
title: "Trinity S³AI Framework — Complete Scientific Collection (76 Discoveries)"
abstract: "We present the Trinity S³AI (Sacred Symbolic AI) Framework, a comprehensive approach to ternary neural networks, FPGA acceleration, and autonomous orchestration. This collection includes 7 bundles covering 76 scientific discoveries across neural network architecture, hardware design, instruction set design, orchestration systems, language design, number formats, and vector symbolic architectures."
